# Belt-and-braces: the Dockerfile COPYs an explicit list (pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock, DOCS.md, src/), so nothing here is shipped today. Keeping dev
# trees and secrets out of the build context guards a future broadened COPY
# and shrinks the context upload.
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
data/
frontend/
tests/
